        "description": "<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/2e955eed-3320-4f2c-9287-96ad8eead680,1793380858597/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C184%2C3072%2C1728%29%3B' alt='A closeup of a person smiling.' width='620' height='349' title='Britain&apos;s Prince Harry meets the winner of the Inspirational Young Person aged 15-18, Rosanna Cornforth-Revill (not pictured) during the WellChild Awards 2026, which celebrates the achievements and resilience of seriously ill youngsters and their families, at the Royal Lancaster Hotel in London, Britain, September 21, 2026.    Aaron Chown/Pool via REUTERS'/><p>As much as Prince Harry may signal his desire to reconcile with the Royal Family, making it happen could be a challenge.</p>",
